ks-action-arrange-unlocked-tooltip = Action layout unlocked.
    Drag actions to move them: off the bar to leave them loose on screen, onto the bin to hide them.
    Right-click a loose action to put it back on the bar.
    Click to lock.
ks-action-arrange-locked-tooltip = Action layout locked: actions only work as buttons.
    Click to unlock and move them around.
ks-action-arrange-unlocked = Action layout unlocked: drag actions to move them.
ks-action-arrange-locked = Action layout locked.
ks-action-arrange-is-locked = The action layout is locked. Unlock it with the padlock beside the action bar.
ks-action-trash-tooltip = Drop an action here to hide it. The actions menu still has it.
ks-action-hidden = {$art} hidden. Drag it out of the actions menu to get it back.
